### Battle Royale

- **Live:** Live since the Chapter 7 Season 4 "Fortnite Override" launch on Aug 20, 2026 (v42.00): the "Battle Royale" experience (Epic island code experience_br) with Build chosen on its Build/Zero Build toggle and Ranked off; Epic's Data API counts about 7.5 million players on Sep 23.
- **Pool as of:** v42.20 (Sep 17, 2026) + hotfixes to Sep 23
- **What is not certain:** Not in this list on purpose: Minigun, Oni Shotgun, Dual Pistols, Flare Gun and Bass Boost were the v42.00 Loot Hacks and left on Sep 3; Deadeye Assault Rifle, Holo Twister Assault Rifle, Wrecker Revolver, Caduceus Staff and Scorpion's Kombat Kit were the v42.10 Loot Hacks and left on Sep 17; the Harpoon Gun was vaulted from unranked on Sep 3 (wiki only, no Epic note). Doubtful: whether the Kingdom Key drops from Chests at Epic rarity; the Firework Flare Gun has only a wiki source. Epic announced Match Overrides for Thursday Sep 24 (Suppressing Fire, Health Siphon) but no weapon changes.
- **Telling it apart on screen:** Wood / stone / metal counters on the HUD mean a Build match (the wiki marks materials "exclusive to Builds"), and the players-left counter starts near 100. Unranked also shows Sprite companions and Loot Hack drops, which Ranked does not have. (https://fortnite.weirdgloop.org/w/Chapter_7:_Season_4/Loot_Pool, https://communities.epicgames.com/thread/v42-00-fortnite-override-battle-royale-update-notes/L5R3, https://communities.epicgames.com/channel/wvDV/battle-royale)
- **Sources:** https://communities.epicgames.com/thread/v42-00-fortnite-override-battle-royale-update-notes/L5R3, https://communities.epicgames.com/thread/v42-10-fortnite-override-battle-royale-update-notes/y3Ub, https://communities.epicgames.com/thread/v42-20-fortnite-override-battle-royale-update-notes/g1Wm, https://communities.epicgames.com/thread/override-overclocked-balance-sprite-and-matchmaking-updates/xqzI, https://www.fortnite.com/news/fortnite-override-break-the-rules-change-the-game (read via the Wayback Machine), https://www.fortnite.com/news/journey-across-worlds-with-kingdom-hearts-in-fortnite (read via the Wayback Machine), https://dev.epicgames.com/documentation/en-us/fortnite/42-20-fortnite-ecosystem-updates-and-release-notes, https://fortnite.weirdgloop.org/w/Chapter_7:_Season_4/Loot_Pool, https://fortnite.weirdgloop.org/w/Chapter_7:_Season_4, https://fortnite.weirdgloop.org/w/Loot_Hack, https://fortnite.weirdgloop.org/w/Adam_Smasher, https://fortnite.weirdgloop.org/w/Kingdom_Key, https://fortnite.weirdgloop.org/w/Fortnite_9th_Birthday

