- **Live:** Live all season as the Zero Build side of the Build/Zero Build toggle inside the same Battle Royale experience (Epic's island description: "In Zero Build..."; the wiki dates the merge into Battle Royale to v39.40, early Feb 2026; Epic's v41.00 notes mention the toggle).
