- **Pool as of:** v42.20 (Sep 17, 2026) + hotfixes to Sep 23
- **What is not certain:** Epic publishes no separate Ranked loot list. Built from the wiki Ranked subpage (last edited Aug 28, 2026) plus Epic's later v42.10/v42.20 additions that carry no Ranked exclusion. Loot Hacks never drop in Ranked (wiki: not in competitive) and Sprites were vaulted from Ranked on Aug 28 (Epic). Unknown: whether the Sep 17 Exotics (Balloon Popper AR, Overpowered Pump, Overclocked 8-Bit, Accelerant Drum Gun) appear in Ranked (the wiki Ranked page does list the Temple Vault Key), whether Adam Smasher and his Mythic Rebecca's Guns are in Ranked, and whether Epic's Aug 26 "Miniguns removed from Competitive" covers Ranked.
