## Names

Names are spelt as Epic's Battle Royale update notes spell them, with plain
apostrophes. Epic is not always consistent, and the game shows them in its own
type, so these differences never change what the owner sees:

| printed | where | the catalog uses | because |
|---|---|---|---|
| Midas’ Masterpiece (curly apostrophe) | [42.00 ecosystem notes](https://dev.epicgames.com/documentation/fortnite/42-00-fortnite-ecosystem-updates-and-release-notes) | Midas' Masterpiece | the v42.00 Battle Royale notes; the id drops the apostrophe either way |
| Sonic’s Power Sneakers | [v42.20 fixes](https://communities.epicgames.com/thread/fixes-and-improvements-in-v42-20/C3rG) | Sonic Power Sneakers | the v42.00 notes and every other fix line |
| Rebecca's Gun | the community wiki's loot tables | Rebecca's Guns | Epic's v42.20 notes |
| EightBit | Verse code, per the 42.00 ecosystem notes | 8-Bit Shotgun | that is the display name; Verse only spells it out |
| Golden Gun | Epic's Blitz notes | Midas' Masterpiece | the nickname is an alias |
| Sentinel Pump, Striker Assault Rifle, Chaos Reloader | Epic's Arenas posts | Sentinel Pump Shotgun, Striker AR, Chaos Reloader Shotgun | the names the weapons carry elsewhere in Epic's notes and in game |
| Machine Pistol | Chapter 3 | Machine SMG | the game renamed it in v23.00; the old name is an alias |

